[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883724813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106438#issuecomment-2883724813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106438","id":2883724813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r4iYN","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T12:57:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T12:57:58Z","body":"That shouldn't hurt to support, but it's a bit of an obscure workaround (even more obscure than our undocumented `DISABLE_GODOT_CI` variable), so I'm afraid you might end up being the only contributor making use of this :)\r\n\r\nIn light of what we discussed a few days ago on RC in https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/coffee-break?msg=Ggg484tcJ89YWW5sF, I think we might want to consider disabling CI builds on forks by default, and make it opt-in instead of opt-out.\r\n\r\nWe should also support a way to run CI on forks only on-demand, which could be done like this (but it really feels like a hack) or with `workflow_dispatch`, which I need to read more about but I think it's worth reconsidering.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883724813/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883751782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106438#issuecomment-2883751782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106438","id":2883751782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r4o9m","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T13:07:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T13:07:13Z","body":"> That shouldn't hurt to support, but it's a bit of an obscure workaround (even more obscure than our undocumented `DISABLE_GODOT_CI` variable), so I'm afraid you might end up being the only contributor making use of this :)\r\n> \r\n> In light of what we discussed a few days ago on RC in https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/coffee-break?msg=Ggg484tcJ89YWW5sF, I think we might want to consider disabling CI builds on forks by default, and make it opt-in instead of opt-out.\r\n> \r\n> We should also support a way to run CI on forks only on-demand, which could be done like this (but it really feels like a hack) or with `workflow_dispatch`, which I need to read more about but I think it's worth reconsidering.\r\n\r\nFully agreed. I'm guessing it might take a while to settle on an opt-in CI workflow, so this change will at least allow interested contributors to reduce their own CI contributions a bit until then.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883751782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883795326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106438#issuecomment-2883795326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106438","id":2883795326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r4zl-","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien